{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defy Death. Defy the Gods. Save the Realm.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your path through a roguelike realm torn apart by divine war. Each run begins with resurrection -  build powerful party synergies and fight through unforgiving battles as you explore and save the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/a63854cd11210a1e232f5bc150888a1d.poster.avif?t=1765999707\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/a63854cd11210a1e232f5bc150888a1d.webm?t=1765999707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/a63854cd11210a1e232f5bc150888a1d.mp4?t=1765999707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn-based Tactical Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Ultimate Charge from every move - whether attacking, casting spells, or defending. Each hero wields a unique Ultimate Ability that can turn the tide: break enemy ranks, empower allies, or unleash overwhelming force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/385af80eafb1b293bccfcd1c34813d79.avif?t=1765999707\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras_big/385af80eafb1b293bccfcd1c34813d79.webp?t=1765999707 width=1560 height=243 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Hero Builds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn new abilities, equip powerful items, and learn mechanic changing Blessings to forge unique builds each run. Upgrades don\u2019t just raise stats - they evolve abilities, unlock new mechanics, and deepen hero playstyles. Victory depends on how you combine your heroes: chain their powers, create devastating synergies, and unlock artifacts that empower your entire party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/b317caea5c2f990a149664c0646b6028.poster.avif?t=1765999707\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/b317caea5c2f990a149664c0646b6028.webm?t=1765999707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/b317caea5c2f990a149664c0646b6028.mp4?t=1765999707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Solo or 3 Player Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your champions alone or rally up to three friends in fast-paced co-op play. With simultaneous turns for all players, battles remain fluid, tactical, and unrelenting as you fight for the realm\u2019s survival together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560360?t=1765999707","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560360?t=1765999707","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/c898c2e2b7ca6f6deb12fe3bff991f94796d0b80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765999707","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/c898c2e2b7ca6f6deb12fe3bff991f94796d0b80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765999707","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"General fantasy medieval violence against heroes, NPCs, and enemies."},"demos":[{"appid":4186400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defy Death. Defy the Gods. Save the Realm.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your path through a roguelike realm torn apart by divine war. Each run begins with resurrection -  build powerful party synergies and fight through unforgiving battles as you explore and save the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/a63854cd11210a1e232f5bc150888a1d.poster.avif?t=1765999707\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/a63854cd11210a1e232f5bc150888a1d.webm?t=1765999707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/a63854cd11210a1e232f5bc150888a1d.mp4?t=1765999707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn-based Tactical Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Ultimate Charge from every move - whether attacking, casting spells, or defending. Each hero wields a unique Ultimate Ability that can turn the tide: break enemy ranks, empower allies, or unleash overwhelming force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/385af80eafb1b293bccfcd1c34813d79.avif?t=1765999707\"